### New Initiatives Section (Major New Feature)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is the largest component. All 88 initiatives will be stored as a **static TypeScript data file** (not in Supabase), keeping the site fast and avoiding migration complexity. Each initiative gets its own detail page via Next.js dynamic routing.

#### [NEW] [initiatives.ts](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/lib/data/initiatives.ts)
- Static data file containing all 88 initiatives with full metadata
- Each initiative has: [id](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/middleware.ts#4-7), `title`, `program`, `programName`, `fiscalYear`, `strategicArea`, `criticality`, `deliveryFocus`, `slug`
- Program legend mapping (A→L with descriptions)
- Operational Activities (BAU) data
- Improvement & Advancement themes

#### [NEW] [InitiativesGrid.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/components/initiatives/InitiativesGrid.tsx)
- Client-side filterable grid for all 88 initiatives
- Filters: Fiscal Year, Program (A–L), Strategic Area, Criticality
- Search by title
- Color-coded criticality badges (Critical=red, High=amber, Medium=blue, Low=gray)
- Cards link to individual initiative detail pages

#### [NEW] [initiatives/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/initiatives/page.tsx)
- Hero section with stats: 88 initiatives, 9 fiscal years, 12 programs
- Summary stats cards by program
- The `InitiativesGrid` component

#### [NEW] [initiatives/[slug]/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/initiatives/[slug]/page.tsx)
- Individual initiative detail page
- Shows: title, program, fiscal year, strategic area, criticality, delivery focus
- Links to related initiatives in the same program
- Back navigation to initiatives listing

#### [NEW] [initiatives/programs/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/initiatives/programs/page.tsx)
- Programs overview page showing all 12 program categories (A–L)
- Each program card shows count of initiatives and description
- Links to filtered initiative views

